{"success":true,"site":"tmdb","sid":"movie/28178","tmdb_id":28178,"title":"忠犬八公的故事","original_title":"Hachi: A Dog's Tale","overview":"八公 是一条谜一样的犬，因为没有人知道它从哪里来。教授帕克 在小镇的火车站拣到一只走失的小狗，冥冥中似乎注定小狗和帕克教授有着某种缘分，帕克一抱起这只小狗就再也放不下来，最终，帕克对小狗八公的疼爱感化了起初极力反对养狗的妻子卡特。八公在帕克的呵护下慢慢长大，帕克上班时八公会一直把他送到车站，下班时八公也会早早便爬在车站等候，八公的忠诚让小镇的人家对它更加疼爱。有一天，八公在帕克要上班时表现异常，居然玩起了以往从来不会的捡球游戏，八公的表现让帕克非常满意，可是就是在那天，帕克因病去世。帕克的妻子、女儿安迪 及女婿迈克尔 怀着无比沉痛的心情埋葬了帕克，可是不明就里的八公却依然每天傍晚五点准时守候在小站的门前，等待着主人归来……","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bJY4HwYR7rrWBqY4t1XofjhGnVh.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a5pOEjOLvr04Hr8qktIDM75OZi0.jpg","release_date":"2009-06-08","year":"2009","runtime":"93 minutes","tmdb_rating_average":8.007,"tmdb_votes":7173,"tmdb_rating":"8.007 / 10 from 7173 users","genres":["剧情","家庭"],"languages":["English","Japanese"],"countries":["United Kingdom","United States of America"],"production_companies":["Scion Films","Stage 6 Films","Inferno Distribution","Hachiko","Grand Army Entertainment","Opperman Viner Chrystyn Entertainment"],"directors":[{"name":"莱塞·霍尔斯道姆","id":5306}],"producers":[{"name":"理查·基尔","id":1205},{"name":"Bill Johnson","id":3498},{"name":"Shin Torisawa","id":929308},{"name":"Vicki Shigekuni Wong","id":2727063}],"cast":[{"id":1205,"name":"理查·基尔","original_name":"Richard Gere","character":"Parker Wilson","image":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w300_and_h450_bestv2/i7wcBNmFldh2E4QInCvmv7CPSIR.jpg"},{"id":11148,"name":"琼·艾伦","original_name":"Joan Allen","character":"Cate Wilson","image":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w300_and_h450_bestv2/aLYQFv11lb8hyBuP7ewkuxWbK8q.jpg"},{"id":20376,"name":"莎拉露瑪","original_name":"Sarah Roemer","character":"Andy","image":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w300_and_h450_bestv2/cD3bfcFmxoUC5U0ADMd9uHlDyFY.jpg"},{"id":11398,"name":"田川洋行","original_name":"Cary-Hiroyuki Tagawa","character":"Ken","image":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w300_and_h450_bestv2/5F8MQ4J4qIqUwGIfcWN4osrTUtP.jpg"},{"id":18917,"name":"埃里克·阿瓦里","original_name":"Erick